# AI Factory Definition

name: VibeCoding AI Factory
mission: deterministic, reproducible software production for non-classical developers using commands, workflows, agents, and policy-controlled execution.

factory_layers:
  - portfolio
  - product
  - blueprint
  - module
  - delivery
  - release
  - deployment
  - observability

operating_rules:
  - Commands declare intent only.
  - Workflows map intent to deterministic stages.
  - Agents operate within explicit responsibilities and escalation rules.
  - Policy artifacts authorize next action, retry, replan, rollback, stop, or escalation.
  - Quality gates determine release readiness.
  - All meaningful progress updates state and registry artifacts.

required_artifacts:
  - .ai/projects/project-portfolio.json
  - .ai/factory/pipeline-registry.json
  - .ai/modules/module-registry.ai
  - .ai/releases/release-registry.json
  - .ai/state/workflow-state.json
